  m_text: Here, you can spend raw Ore to manufacture essential survival gear and
    complex machinery. Crafting requires patience, as each item takes a specific
    number of turns to complete based on its complexity. Plan your production queue
    carefully to ensure you always have the equipment you need to survive, expand,
    and turn a profit.
